Z||000019||fogglethorpe||11-06-2001||04:36 PM||||...there was the time in high school, when I was innocently sitting in Geography class, and realized I was in my underwear. Then, when I tried to run out of the room, my feet felt glued to the floor, and I couldn't leave. After that, I...oh wait, that was a dream.<BR>Whew, thank goodness...<P>------------------<BR>I don't think so;therefore, I'm probably not.||||reg||1
Z||000020||fierospeeder||11-06-2001||05:51 PM||||Everytime my car breaks down at the stoplight.<P>Happened three times with my tbird.  two were my alternator going out.  One was from pepboys, the other was one i grabbed from the junkyard and lasted me a year.  When buying from pepboys, get a lifetime warranty, not a 1 year.<P>The other time is my ignition module going out at the stoplight.  Had to push my car to a bar across the street.  Its a tbird so its heavy to push.  I had a guy in a jap suv help me push my car, after i got it across the street.  The ign module was my fault, i changed it to one i got from the junkyard, thinking that my old one was bad and I wanted to see if it changed the way my car ran.<P>When my motorcycle runs out of gas at a stoplight, and it takes a few times to get it started when i switch it to my reserve.  This is only bad when the light turns green, and i find it hesitating.<P>This was xmas time, working as a cashier at a grocery store.  My coworker, shes very nice and she does more of the customer service stuff, and counting the money etc...<BR>She comes up to me with kleenex and says a customer complained that i had something in my nose.  So i blew my nose.  Everytime i go to work, i double check if all my holes are clean.   It would have felt better if the customer told me herself.  "i think you have to blow your nose" etc... instead of complaining.  <P><BR>Highschool, when you had to wear shorts in gym.  Everyone starts pulling everyone elses pants down.  No matter who.<P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000021||DaRkLoRD||11-06-2001||07:00 PM||||in the last 2 months...<P>-got a rental car. the inside door handle was broken, security was laughing at me when I couldn't get out of the car to sign in..<BR>-backed out of a friends driveway with my taurus, wondered why my car was so sluggish.. found out my e-brake was on, and I'd plowed a nice deep trench in his yard when I pushed the locked rear wheels.. (sorry dave!)<BR>-spent an hour trying to get a VCR unlocked from a cart at work, cause we needed another vcr as ours was "misplaced"... afterwards, my boss asked me why I simply didn't move the projector to the cart that already had the vcr... they were laughing for the rest of the day.. the vcr still has the lock, chain, brakets and remains of rivets on it, but it's on the other cart... heh<P>and let's not forget all the times I went to school with the wrong binders, shirt on backards cause I was so tired in the morning.. going to the wrong classroom and not realizing it for at least 5 minutes into the class... calling a girl and being so nervous I didn't even realize it was her best friend that answered the phone... (took a minute for me to shut up, so she could finally say that the girl I was calling wasn't there..) spun out in front of a club downtown, nearly running into a minivan..<P>oh yeah, I also put my car in a ditch.<BR>backwards.... (and no, I didn't spin it..)<P>but I have to say the worst is going out of town with your parents.... you're at a mall, just got there, and agreed on a time to meet later, and having your mom say VERY LOUDLY to you (just as a group of cute girls walks by) "I'm going to Sears, do you need any new undies?"<P>please.. shoot me now..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>------------------<BR>     <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>     <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 11-06-2001).]||||reg||8
Z||000022||Return of Fiero||11-06-2001||08:45 PM||||you know, i dont really have a good one, theres the time i bounced my head off the gas tank and the ground a few times (ouch) um, looking up a girls skirt when i was a freshman, and leaning a bit far back falling into another girls lap, the chesse grater and the "willy" incedent (dont ask)but the best one i can think of was this. i had a friend/mentor going up, and he happened to be a cop. this will be relavent later. myself and a few friends decided we wanted to go skinny dipping after dark (obviously) on a lake where there were MANY houses right on the water. ok, i was a kid, and non to bright. so kelly, amanda, kim, david and myself are in the water, just having a good time (but not too good, to ease your minds) when jodi and paul decide they are cold. they get out, and amanda follows. after they get dressed, kim decides shes getting out too, and im on the dock about 600 ft out. as i start swiming in, and right when kim gets to the launch dock and is ready to pull out of the water, a light hits me. a bright light, like the police have on the front drivers side. then a booming, but familiar voice says "Freeze" so i stop swimming.he starts talking about laws and ordanaces over the bullhorn, and tells me he has his gun drawn not to move, the harbor patrol was comming. now i know it was my officer friend, and started yelling back at timmy, as i swam back in, timmy kept the light on me, and i kept calling him every name in the book. when i got to land, and went to get my clothes, i got the wierd idea to look around, and almost every house had a light on and a person in the window looking at my. i calmly gathered my items, and dressed as i walked back toward the house. not that great, but it made my cheeks red, both pair.<P>Myke||||reg||11
